","notes":"Use this eight-person room when a group needs a shared table, monitor, and whiteboard; confirm the booking card outside before settling in.","short_summary":"An eight-person fifth-floor room for collaborative academic work.","evidence_claim":"University Libraries lists MIKC Group Study Room 520 on the fifth floor with a capacity of eight; group rooms include a conference table, monitor, and whiteboard.","source_url":"https://library.unr.edu/resources/technology-and-spaces/room-reservations/our-spaces/group-study-spaces","source_title":"Group study spaces | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Book online when needed; if unreserved, check the posted reservation card before using the room.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"unr-mikc-faculty-graduate-reserved-studies-421","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Faculty and Graduate Reserved Studies","title":"Faculty and Graduate Reserved Studies","subtitle":"MIKC 421, Mathewson-IGT Knowledge Center","notes":"Graduate students and faculty can request access for quiet work with carrels, computers, tables, and outlets; apply for WolfCard activation ahead of time.","short_summary":"A key-card-access quiet zone for authorized faculty and graduate students.","evidence_claim":"University Libraries states that suite 421 is a designated quiet zone for authorized faculty and graduate students, with assigned studies, lockers, computers, outlets, tables, and chairs.","source_url":"https://library.unr.edu/resources/technology-and-spaces/room-reservations/policies/faculty-and-graduate-study-spaces","source_title":"Faculty and graduate study spaces | University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Restricted to